+This patch makes the per-rank draft graph/eager decision uniform.  IndexShare-off
+instead removes the thing that makes it diverge: the guard term
+`draft_input.dsa_topk_indices is None` is seeded on the PD decode leg from
+RDMA-shipped per-request payloads (eagle_disaggregation.py:54-59), so it is a
+function of which requests each rank happens to hold -- an idle rank gets None, a
+busy one gets a tensor.  No seed, no divergence, no vote needed.
