+2a's own evidence does not come from a revert; it comes from runtime state.  A
+py-spy dump caught a BUSY rank blocked inside dsa_backend on .max().item() while
+IDLE peers had already advanced into the next collective -- the divergence itself,
+observed.  After the fix no rank appears in dsa_backend in a dump again and PD
+warmup passes on all 8 ranks.  Fix A2 (the two unconditional .cpu() syncs on the
